# Gitignored files copied into every Claude Code worktree under `.claude/worktrees/`.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so it gets only what git tracks. The three documents below
# are authoritative whenever present and are deliberately never committed, which means an
# agent working in a worktree would decide without them. They are copied in so that it does
# not. Gitignore syntax; only gitignored files are ever copied.
#
# Deliberately absent: `.env`, `docker/env/*.env` and `.mcp.json`. They carry real
# credentials, and nothing an isolated agent is asked to do needs them -- the database-backed
# tests skip themselves cleanly when `PP_DATABASE_URL` and `PP_MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL` are
# unset rather than failing, and the shared Docker stack, the shared PostgreSQL and AWS are
# mutually exclusive resources that no parallel agent may hold.

